{"id":"A1-L026","title":"Key verb: do","cefr":"A1","level":"A1","unit":"A1-U02","focus":"Verbo-chave: do","targets":{"grammar":"Verbo-chave: do","pron":"sílaba tônica em palavras comuns","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":["I’d like…"],"words":["dishes","laundry","housework","fair","tidy","best","share","dust","vacuum","mop","broom","trash","sponge","detergent"],"field":"Rotina","genre":"Editorial / opinião","skill":"Escrita","words_min":14},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 26 · Key verb: do","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Verbo-chave: do.","**Expressões:** I’d like….","**Pronúncia:** sílaba tônica em palavras comuns.","**14 palavras novas** (rotina).","**Texto do dia:** editorial / opinião."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A1):** eu consigo usar do em tarefas e pedidos educados com I’d like…"},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você ainda não faz as provas, mas já treina o formato de tarefas curtas que elas usam.","Esta aula treina **escrever frases claras e corretas (IELTS Writing, TOEFL Writing)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["dishes","louça"],["laundry","roupa suja"],["housework","serviço doméstico"],["fair","justo"],["tidy","arrumado"],["best","melhor"],["share","dividir"],["dust","pó"],["vacuum","aspirador"],["mop","esfregão"],["broom","vassoura"],["trash","lixo"],["sponge","esponja"],["detergent","detergente"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An editorial","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Do Your Own Dishes","paras":["In many homes, one person **does** all the housework. That is not fair. Everyone should **do** something: the dishes, the laundry, the shopping.","**Do** your homework, **do** your best, and **do** a little each day. A tidy home makes a calm mind.","I’d like to see families share the work. **I’d like** every child to learn it."],"kicker":"OPINION","by":"Home Weekly","gloss":[["dishes","louça"],["laundry","roupa suja"],["fair","justo"],["tidy","arrumado"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"One person does all the housework in many homes.","ans":"T","why":"Primeira frase."},{"q":"The writer says it is fair.","ans":"F","why":"“That is not fair.”"},{"q":"The writer wants children to learn housework.","ans":"T","why":"“I’d like every child to learn it.”"},{"q":"The writer is a mother.","ans":"NG","why":"Não diz."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“dishes” means…","opts":["louça","roupa","comida"],"ans":0,"why":"dishes = louça."},{"q":"“fair” means…","opts":["justo","caro","longo"],"ans":0,"why":"fair = justo."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Key verb: do","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Uso","Exemplo"],"rows":[["tarefas","**do the dishes / the laundry / homework**"],["esforço","**do your best**"],["auxiliar","**Do you like it? I don’t know.**"],["atividade","**do exercise / yoga**"]],"cap":"Do: sentidos"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"I’d like…","body":"**I’d like + substantivo** = Eu gostaria de…: *I’d like a coffee.* Mais educado que *I want.*"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"I ___ the dishes every day.","a":"do","why":"do + tarefa.","say":"I do the dishes"},{"s":"She ___ her homework. (do)","a":"does","why":"she → does."},{"s":"I’d ___ a coffee, please.","a":"like","why":"I’d like.","say":"I’d like a coffee"},{"s":"Do your ___ . (best)","a":"best","why":"do your best."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["dishes","louça"],["laundry","roupa suja"],["homework","lição de casa"],["housework","serviço doméstico"],["fair","justo"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["it","I'll","make"],"ans":"I'll make it","pt":"Eu faço!"},{"words":["laundry","I","do","the"],"ans":"I do the laundry","pt":"Eu lavo a roupa."}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"dishes","pos":"noun","pt":"louça","ex":"Do the dishes.","expt":"Lave a louça."},{"w":"laundry","pos":"noun","pt":"roupa suja","ex":"Do the laundry.","expt":"Lave a roupa."},{"w":"housework","pos":"noun","pt":"serviço doméstico","ex":"Share the housework.","expt":"Divida o serviço."},{"w":"fair","pos":"adj","pt":"justo","ex":"It is fair.","expt":"É justo."},{"w":"tidy","pos":"adj","pt":"arrumado","ex":"A tidy room.","expt":"Um quarto arrumado."},{"w":"best","pos":"noun","pt":"melhor","ex":"Do your best.","expt":"Faça o melhor."},{"w":"share","pos":"verb","pt":"dividir","ex":"Share the work.","expt":"Divida o trabalho."},{"w":"dust","pos":"word","pt":"pó","ex":"Remove the dust.","expt":"Tire o pó."},{"w":"vacuum","pos":"word","pt":"aspirador","ex":"Use the vacuum.","expt":"Use o aspirador."},{"w":"mop","pos":"word","pt":"esfregão","ex":"A wet mop.","expt":"Um esfregão molhado."},{"w":"broom","pos":"word","pt":"vassoura","ex":"Sweep with a broom.","expt":"Varra com uma vassoura."},{"w":"trash","pos":"word","pt":"lixo","ex":"Take out the trash.","expt":"Leve o lixo para fora."},{"w":"sponge","pos":"word","pt":"esponja","ex":"A soft sponge.","expt":"Uma esponja macia."},{"w":"detergent","pos":"word","pt":"detergente","ex":"A bottle of detergent.","expt":"Um frasco de detergente."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**I’d like…** — Eu gostaria de…","**Who does the dishes?** — Quem lava a louça?","**I do.** — Eu lavo.","**Who does the laundry?** — Quem lava a roupa?","**Do your part.** — Faça a sua parte.","**It’s your turn.** — É a sua vez."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"do","pt":"fazer","forms":[["I do","I do the dishes."],["you do","You do your best."],["he / she / it does","Sh